@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Create order (replace customerId with an existing, active customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "partId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "partId": 2, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Insufficient stock returns 409 and rolls the whole order back
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "items": [{ "partId": 1, "quantity": 9999 }]
}
